homebridge-comelit-doorbell

This product is a modified version of homebridge-comelit-intercom 1.1.1,
published to npm by danimal4326 (https://www.npmjs.com/package/homebridge-comelit-intercom).
The original repository, github.com/Danimal4326/homebridge-comelit-intercom,
is no longer available; this project starts from the published package.

The original package ships an Apache License 2.0 LICENSE file (its package.json
declares MIT). Both permit this redistribution; this project is distributed
under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications since 1.1.1 are listed in CHANGELOG.md and in the git history.
